Subject: [M150] [wasm] Check value type before i8/i16 load elimination

Original change's description:
> [wasm] Check value type before i8/i16 load elimination
>
> WasmLoadElimination::TruncateAndExtendOrType previously emitted Word32
> shifts/masks for kWasmI8 and kWasmI16 fields before checking the cached
> value's type. On unreachable cast paths where an unrelated field type
> (such as f64 or f32) was cached at the same field index, this wrapped a
> non-Word32 node in Word32 operations.
>
> Validate the cached value's Wasm type against field_type.Unpacked()
> (including dead, uninhabited, top, and non-Wasm-typed values) before
> truncating or extending packed fields.
>
